- **Parallel extraction:** All CPU cores used locally; pdfplumber one open per page.
- **Kaggle remote extraction:** Bundle publish scripts, GPU notebook server, `kaggle_client.py`, `EXTRACT_PROVIDER` routing in `main.py`.
