**Next:** (1) Smoke-test Azure explanations: regex build → open topic → `explanation_status=ready` + Listen (restart backend after chat URL/`/openai/v1` edits). (2) Decide whether to tighten regex title boundaries / column reading order (deferred). (3) **Step 5:** `qa.py` + `/ask` + `AskPanel`. (4) Step 7 image routing. (5) `# TODO v2`: skip Kaggle upload when page range set; background extract; disk cache; optional Kaggle CPU extract+regex without Llama.

**Dev defaults (2026-08-13):** `EXTRACT_PROVIDER=local`, `CHAPTERWISE_TOPIC_BUILDER=regex` (unset in `.env` is OK), `TEXT_PROVIDER=azure` (`gpt-4.1-mini` via `AZURE_CHAT_*`), `CHAPTERWISE_TEXT_EXTRACTOR=rapidocr`. Kaggle is optional (extract offload / legacy Llama); not required for TOC or explanations. Notebook LLM defaults if used: `MAX_NEW_TOKENS=512`, `MAX_TIME_SECONDS=90`, `CHAT_JOB_MAX_SECONDS=120`.
